  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business and Human Rights in Asia: Enabling Sustainable Economic Growth through the Protect, Respect and Remedy Framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall aim of the action is to promote the agenda on Business and Human Rights and ensure that it is further taken up by Asian governments and business, through an EU-UN partnership, thereby promoting multilateralism and levelling the playing field for businesses that integrate human rights considerations into their operations and supply chains.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
